            "title": "Why Apellis Pharmaceuticals (APLS) Could Gain from EMPAVELI\u2019s Edge in Rare Kidney Disease Treatment",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "Apellis Pharmaceuticals recently announced new one-year results from the Phase 3 VALIANT study, highlighting sustained efficacy and favorable safety for EMPAVELI in treating rare kidney diseases, including C3 glomerulopathy and IC-MPGN. Notably, EMPAVELI achieved durable proteinuria reduction and outperformed iptacopan in indirect comparisons, reinforcing its position in a highly specialized nephrology market. We'll explore how EMPAVELI's competitive edge in rare kidney diseases could...",
            "pubDate": "2025-10-24T10:13:30Z",
